{
    "title": "FreshDirect: Grocery Delivery",
    "description": "Get food that delivers you: Grocery shop from anywhere for delivery to your home or business. FreshDirect offers the best in-season foods, local finds, easy meals, and all your favorite brands. Available to both residential and business customers in the greater New York City metropolitan area, with seasonal service to eastern Long Island and the Jersey Shore.\r\n\r\nPerks of using the FreshDirect app:\r\n\u2022 Easily place or modify your grocery order from your mobile device.\r\n\u2022 Find just what you\u2019re looking for (or discover something new) with browsable categories, curated lists, and an improved search.\r\n\u2022 Pick a timeslot and schedule your delivery window. 2-hour express and same-day delivery options available in select areas.\r\n\u2022 Shop your previous purchases, create lists, and easily reorder your faves.\r\n\u2022 Have a question? Quickly get in touch with our customer service team.\r\n\r\nAbout FreshDirect\r\nFounded and based in New York City since 2002, FreshDirect is a leading online grocer that\u2019s committed to delivering the highest quality, freshest food. By working directly with growers, producers, and local food innovators, we create food experiences and drive simple, healthy solutions to make every day better for our customers. Checking grocery shopping off your list should be easy, and we\u2019ve thought of everything to get it done around your busy schedule. For more information, visit www.freshdirect.com.\u00a0",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get food that delivers you: Grocery shop from anywhere for delivery to your home or business. FreshDirect offers the best in-season foods, local finds, easy meals, and all your favorite brands. Available to both residential and business customers in the greater New York City metropolitan area, with seasonal service to eastern Long Island and the Jersey Shore.<br><br>Perks of using the FreshDirect app:<br>\u2022 Easily place or modify your grocery order from your mobile device.<br>\u2022 Find just what you\u2019re looking for (or discover something new) with browsable categories, curated lists, and an improved search.<br>\u2022 Pick a timeslot and schedule your delivery window. 2-hour express and same-day delivery options available in select areas.<br>\u2022 Shop your previous purchases, create lists, and easily reorder your faves.<br>\u2022 Have a question? Quickly get in touch with our customer service team.<br><br>About FreshDirect<br>Founded and based in New York City since 2002, FreshDirect is a leading online grocer that\u2019s committed to delivering the highest quality, freshest food. By working directly with growers, producers, and local food innovators, we create food experiences and drive simple, healthy solutions to make every day better for our customers. Checking grocery shopping off your list should be easy, and we\u2019ve thought of everything to get it done around your busy schedule. For more information, visit www.freshdirect.com.\u00a0",
